{
  "title": "WAF / Shield · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "웹 요청 필터링과 대량 공격 완화를 역할에 맞게 적용합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span> / Shield</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#guide-1\">WAF에서 요청을 처리하는 방법</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#guide-2\">서비스 보호 범위 구성</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>61 / 62</span></div><h1>WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span> / Shield</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS WAF는 <strong>HTTP·HTTPS 요청을 검사해 웹 애플리케이션을 보호하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 특정 공격 패턴, IP 범위, 과도한 요청 등을 규칙으로 탐지하고 처리할 수 있습니다.</p><p>AWS Shield는 DDoS 공격<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 완화에 초점을 둡니다. 웹 요청의 내용과 요청량을 제어하는 WAF와 함께, 서비스에 맞는 여러 보호 수단을 구성합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"web-acls-and-rules\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"allow-block-count-captcha-and-challenge\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"managed-rule-groups\"></span><h2>WAF에서 요청을 처리하는 방법</h2><p>웹 ACL에 규칙을 모아 CloudFront나 ALB 같은 지원 대상에 연결합니다. 관리형 규칙을 사용하거나 애플리케이션에 맞는 조건을 직접 만들 수 있습니다.</p><p>일치한 요청을 허용·차단하거나, 먼저 Count로 기록해 영향을 관찰할 수 있습니다. 속도 기반 규칙은 일정 기준을 넘는 요청을 제한하는 데 사용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"rate-based-rules-and-ip-sets\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"scope-logging-and-firewall-manager\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"shield-standard\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"shield-advanced\"></span><h2>서비스 보호 범위 구성</h2><p>Shield Standard는 기본적인 DDoS 보호를 제공하며, 더 높은 수준의 보호와 운영 지원이 필요하면 Shield Advanced를 검토합니다.</p><p>WAF 규칙은 정상 사용자 요청에도 영향을 줄 수 있으므로 로그와 지표를 보며 조정합니다. 인증, 권한 검증, 애플리케이션 취약점 수정은 서비스 내부에서도 수행합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>웹 요청 보호 흐름</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>외부 요청</strong><span>사용자·자동화 트래픽</span></li><li><strong>WAF 규칙</strong><span>패턴·주소·요청량 검사</span></li><li><strong>웹 서비스</strong><span>허용된 요청 처리</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">DDoS 완화와 애플리케이션 요청 검사는 함께 적용할 수 있는 보호 계층입니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>CloudFront 앞의 WAF에서 SQL 주입 패턴을 검사하고 과도한 로그인 요청을 제한합니다. 처음에는 Count로 정상 사용자 영향을 확인한 뒤 차단 규칙을 적용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>DDoS 공격</strong> — 다수의 출발지에서 대량의 요청이나 트래픽을 보내 정상적인 서비스 이용을 방해하는 공격입니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/waf/latest/developerguide/what-is-aws-waf.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What are AWS WAF, AWS Shield Advanced, AWS Shield network security director and AWS Firewall Manager? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/waf/latest/developerguide/shield-chapter.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS Shield ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q066/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q066\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q066\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q066</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q066/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter SQL injection patterns and excessive HTTP requests before they reach an ALB. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q066\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS STS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q066\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q066\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q066\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>가 웹 요청의 규칙·속도 기반 필터링에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q067\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q067\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q067</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q067/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Protection against large-scale DDoS attacks is the primary requirement. Which AWS service family should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q067\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q067\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q067\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Shield</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q067\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Proxy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">Shield</a>는 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>의 DDoS <span class=\"full-name\">(Distributed Denial of Service)</span> 보호 서비스다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>는 웹 요청 필터링에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,1\" data-question=\"Q090\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q090\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q090</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q090/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO services should be considered to mitigate malicious web requests and DDoS attacks in front of CloudFront?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Shield</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DMS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>는 웹 요청 규칙, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">Shield</a>는 DDoS <span class=\"full-name\">(Distributed Denial of Service)</span> 보호에 중점을 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q097\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q097\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q097</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q097/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An ALB must terminate browser HTTPS connections using a certificate that is issued and renewed as a managed service. What should be attached?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q097\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q097\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q097\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q097\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ACM certificate</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> 같은 통합 서비스에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a> 인증서를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q003\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q003\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q003</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to reduce static image download latency for users worldwide and lower requests to its origin server. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS snapshots</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">엣지</a>에 콘텐츠를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>해 사용자 가까이 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">Edge Location</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">이전 용어 <b>VPN / Direct Connect</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">다음 용어 <b>Well-Architected</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
